      "content_summary": "Standard procedures for managing tickets with inconsistent behavior across browsers, data mismatches, or unresponsive services where root cause cannot be immediately determined.",
      "content_body": "When symptoms like inconsistent browser behavior or transient service unresponsiveness cannot be reproduced, gather comprehensive HAR files and console logs from the affected session. Insufficient information is a common root cause; ensure the customer confirms their environment configuration is supported by the current product version. If the configuration is unsupported, educate the customer on standard requirements and close the ticket as a configuration change request. For cases that remain unreproducible after initial triage, close as a duplicate if a related known issue exists, otherwise monitor for further reports before escalating."
