      "content_body": "If the Rate Limiter is unresponsive or showing data mismatches, check for configuration drift between the central store and active nodes. Verify that all required environment variables are present and correctly formatted, as missing values often prevent policy updates from propagating. Operator errors in policy syntax can also cause feature flags to appear non-functional; validate configurations against the schema before applying. Once errors are corrected, trigger a manual refresh to ensure the new policy is applied. Educate users on the necessity of validating configuration changes in a staging environment to prevent production drift."
