      "content_body": "When the Analytics Dashboard exhibits high latency or intermittent failures, investigate database query timeouts which often indicate resource exhaustion. In older deployments, this was frequently due to capacity limitations during peak load times. Prior to the introduction of auto-scaling features, the primary resolution was a manual capacity increase or infrastructure replacement to add more read replicas. If capacity adjustments do not resolve the issue, consider adjusting rate limits on API calls feeding the dashboard to prevent backend saturation. Note that current versions handle this via dynamic scaling, but legacy instances may still require manual intervention."
