      "content_body": "Users may report account lockouts or 'access denied' errors when the LDAP Connector detects potential brute-force attempts or unauthorized access. Check if an expired certificate is causing connection warnings that trigger security policies. Improper access reviews can result in stale credentials leading to unexpected elevated privilege observations or missing audit logs. If credential rotation was performed but not propagated, repeat the rotation to ensure synchronization. Complete a full access review to validate permissions and update the LDAP connector configuration to resolve persistent authentication blocks."
