      "content_body": "The Admin Console may report 'out of disk space', 'backup job failed', or 'database deadlock detected' when underlying storage or database resources are exhausted. These symptoms often indicate a capacity limitation or a data quality issue requiring manual reconciliation. Check for replication lag which can cause backup verification failures if the replica is not synchronized. Run index rebuild scripts if corruption is suspected, or apply a data repair script to resolve inconsistencies. If resource exhaustion is recurrent, plan for a capacity increase or infrastructure replacement to prevent future critical disk usage alerts."
